  * FocalTech FT3658U touch controller on GENI SE4 (SPI, 0x990000).
  *
- * Included from sweet_touch.c; alitouch=1 probes, alitouch=2 also runs stage B.
+ * Included from sweet_touch.c; alitouch=1 probes, alitouch=2 runs stage B,
+ * alitouch=3 also polls CRC-checked touch reports and dispatches HID events.
  * Stage A ONLY ORs the three QUP0 clock-vote bits (S4, M_AHB, S_AHB) into
  * GCC_QUPV3_WRAP_0_CLK_ENA (0x52008), exactly what Linux does. No TLMM
  * writes, no RPMh votes, no SPI traffic, no GENI register writes in stage A.
@@ -71,6 +72,7 @@
 }
 
